msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"What's up with that fortune? There's no way it's right! My friend said she "
"was good, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "What's this about a fortune teller?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"It's outrageous! I should go give her a piece of my mind! She said she'd "
"give me a special reading, then tricked me out of 150,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I can't believe I paid 30,000 yen for that! Do you know what I could buy "
"with 30,000 yen? I'm going to get my money back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "We must've gone to the same fortune teller."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"What? Did she get you, too? We really ought to all go complain to her "
"together. I won't rest until I tell her what I think of her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Mi sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Let us know if you see her again. I am going to slap her silly!"
msgstr ""

